{"id":19245,"path":"/listening/a2/my-friends-listening-test/","parentId":1140,"order":840,"section":"listening","level":"a2","depth":3,"title":"My friends – A2 English Listening Test","seo":{"title":"My friends - A2 English Listening Test - Test-English","description":"Listening comprehension test - pre-intermediate (CEFR A2 level). Prepare for Cambridge A2 KEY (KET), IELTS (3.5), or TOEIC (225 - 545).","image":"/media/uploads/A2%E2%80%93Listening_My-friends.jpg"},"modified":"2025-06-05T10:22:03","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>A2 English Listening Test</h3> <h5>Listen to Nicolas talking about his friends. For questions 1 to 10, choose true or false.</h5> <p></p> <div class=\"videoWrapper\"> <div data-youtube=\"7f00NAa1toA\"></div> </div> <h6>See the full list of <a href=\"/listening/a2/\">A2 listening tests</a></h6> <div class=\"list-separator-dots\"><span>Questions</span></div> <div data-quiz=\"703\"></div>"],"explanation":null,"quizzes":[{"id":703,"questions":[{"id":6006,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Nicolas met Kevin at primary school. </div>","choices":[{"id":10168,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>True</span>"},{"id":10169,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>False</span>"}]},{"id":6007,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Nicolas and Kevin often went swimming together. </div>","choices":[{"id":10170,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>True</span>"},{"id":10171,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>False</span>"}]},{"id":6008,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Nicolas and Kevin were both good at their schoolwork at primary school.</div>","choices":[{"id":10172,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>True</span>"},{"id":10173,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>False</span>"}]},{"id":6009,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Neither Nicolas nor Kevin enjoyed playing sports. </div>","choices":[{"id":10174,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>True</span>"},{"id":10175,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>False</span>"}]},{"id":6011,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Kevin enjoyed going to the gym at secondary school, but Nicolas didn’t.</div>","choices":[{"id":10178,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>True</span>"},{"id":10179,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>False</span>"}]},{"id":6012,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Nicolas doesn’t see Kevin very often these days. </div>","choices":[{"id":10180,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>True</span>"},{"id":10181,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>False</span>"}]},{"id":6013,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Charlie and Nicolas have similar personalities. </div>","choices":[{"id":10182,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>True</span>"},{"id":10183,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>False</span>"}]},{"id":6014,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Charlie liked Nicolas because he was similar to his parents. </div>","choices":[{"id":10184,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>True</span>"},{"id":10185,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>False</span>"}]},{"id":6015,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Charlie and Nicolas both finished relationships at about the same time. </div>","choices":[{"id":10186,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>True</span>"},{"id":10187,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>False</span>"}]},{"id":6018,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Charlie and Nicolas play computer games and racquetball together.</div>","choices":[{"id":10192,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>True</span>"},{"id":10193,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>False</span>"}]}]}]}